    narr:narration """Dave Quantum has initiated a [technical migration](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786699966601_1) of the organization's analytics pipeline from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB, citing [performance and cost efficiencies](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786699966601_2). The decision is framed with [authoritative finality](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786699966601_3), supported by [quantifiable performance claims](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786699966601_4) and a [concrete delivery timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786699966601_5) set for Q3 2026. His communication style across these expressions consistently employs parallelism and structured, matter-of-fact assertions to underscore the operational necessity of the shift.""" ;
